<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA 75-1 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 75-1 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 75 for 1 at lunch on the first day of the first test match against Sri Lanka at Colombo's R.Premadasa stadium on Saturday.</p>
</text>
